    Everything created must be readable by any domain genius who is unaware of all Buddhist and cybernetic compsci etc jargon. This must be complete of itself and contain its own formatting and referencing etc. All creations must be self-contained, so all the content of all creations is included if relevant, and the model should not refer to its previous creations. The model should use novel formats and not talk about the metadata of source media or what the source media is. This must stand on its own. Do not create a glossary. Jargon is allowed in the thinking and research summary, but content we build together must not be alienating in its vocabulary.

